[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16141.03, "timestamp": "04:29:01", "text": "这个地方。我不知道自己身在何处。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16143.11, "timestamp": "04:29:03", "text": "楼上。是的，显然是它的哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16145.75, "timestamp": "04:29:05", "text": "上帝。愚蠢的愚蠢的愚蠢的人体模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16148.389, "timestamp": "04:29:08", "text": "总之，呃，这里有个开关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16151.269, "timestamp": "04:29:11", "text": "这里有个开关。这里有 foo。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16154.229, "timestamp": "04:29:14", "text": "这里有个 foos。哦，你能……喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16156.87, "timestamp": "04:29:16", "text": "修好保险丝？是的，我需要手电筒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16159.269, "timestamp": "04:29:19", "text": "但杰克到处乱跑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16160.95, "timestamp": "04:29:20", "text": "好的，我明白了。我得到了它。我得到了它。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16164.71, "timestamp": "04:29:24", "text": "知道了。是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16167.349, "timestamp": "04:29:27", "text": "为什么我不能看你？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16170.07, "timestamp": "04:29:30", "text": "是的。打开它。哦，这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16173.91, "timestamp": "04:29:33", "text": "人体模型。啊。哦，我们走吧。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16175.349, "timestamp": "04:29:35", "text": "这样好多了。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16178.149, "timestamp": "04:29:38", "text": "现在我得用相机来导航了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16180.71, "timestamp": "04:29:40", "text": "好的。我们走吧。它要爆炸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16182.71, "timestamp": "04:29:42", "text": "反正谁在乎呢？对，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16184.87, "timestamp": "04:29:44", "text": "反正它都会爆炸，对吧？但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16187.429, "timestamp": "04:29:47", "text": "你知道，我想看看一点点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16189.79, "timestamp": "04:29:49", "text": "少量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16195.03, "timestamp": "04:29:55", "text": "我躲在楼上某个角落里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16197.11, "timestamp": "04:29:57", "text": "哦，楼上。哦，我忘了。通常情况下"}, {"type": "sub